# MaCSad admin policy

Import AdminInvariants from "./admin_invariants.lg".
Import BoardRowDecoder from "./board_row_decoder.lg".
Import BoardWirePolicy from "./board_wire_policy.lg".

This facade preserves the administrative component's stable policy names. The
effect-free leaves own invariant, envelope, and canonical-row behavior without
wiring a network request or rendered state.

## To kanbanColumnCount () -> Int:
    Return invariantKanbanColumnCount().

## To closedAcceptsOrdinaryWork (anyCommand: Bool) -> Bool:
    Return invariantClosedAcceptsOrdinaryWork(anyCommand).

## To decodeAdminBoardEnvelope (body: Text, expectedWorkspace: Text) -> Seq of Text:
    Return decodeBoardEnvelope(body, expectedWorkspace).

## To decodeAdminBoardRow (row: Text) -> Text:
    Return decodeBoardRow(row).
